    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds like a very optimistic take. But isn't it true that the sheer scale of the government spending required would lead to massive debt and inflation, which would create more instability than the transition itself? Can you look at the specific risks regarding fiscal policy and the disruption to existing supply chains?",
